# Cloudflare Pages and Netlify (the same format): the headers of the web
# node's pages, copied into the bundle by build.sh here. Cross-origin
# isolation (COOP and COEP) gives the node SharedArrayBuffer, and with it
# threads; without it the node doesn't start. The hosts' default
# Cache-Control (revalidate) suits every file here. A WASM on an asset host
# (WASM_URL) gets its caching there.
# build.sh puts the build's Content-Security-Policy (build-info.json,
# made by ../../regression/webnode/csp.py) in place of the placeholder.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: @CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY@
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), serial=(), usb=()
